<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Apr 10 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 1775, tin down 40, lead up 50, zinc down 1650, aluminium down 2450, nickel up 144, aluminium alloy down 260</p>
</text>
